                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9323d80c-9e96-4d9a-9906-d4facb9a9ac4",
                        "entry_id": "adabbaba-d3b2-3cd7-933e-91c9c6d52ac8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "calami"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "03d9e30f-9a71-31c9-bd15-eba9d54163f9",
                        "entry_id": "adabbaba-d3b2-3cd7-933e-91c9c6d52ac8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The sweet flag, Acorus calamus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "96ad6e7e-2be4-4be4-afc0-d753c7931309",
                                "sense_id": "03d9e30f-9a71-31c9-bd15-eba9d54163f9",
                                "text": "A garden inclosed is my sister, my spouse; a spring shut up, a fountain sealed. Thy plants are an orchard of pomegranates, with pleasant fruits; camphire, with spikenard, Spikenard and saffron; calamus and cinnamon, with all trees of frankincense; myrrh and aloes, with all the chief spices"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "daf3bffe-e7c5-37d8-b35d-184d40b40e9b",
                        "entry_id": "adabbaba-d3b2-3cd7-933e-91c9c6d52ac8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A quill; the hard, horny, hollow, and more or less transparent part of the stem or scape of a feather."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94df5830-aa22-4b39-a987-93516fe291cd",
                                "sense_id": "daf3bffe-e7c5-37d8-b35d-184d40b40e9b",
                                "text": "Thus, the four distinct feather parts that have been compared as to amino acid content to note whether or not the composition is uniform are rachis, barbs, calamus and medulla."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "53efb414-e3d8-4335-baae-775b21ce3f4a",
                                "sense_id": "daf3bffe-e7c5-37d8-b35d-184d40b40e9b",
                                "text": "In follicles late in feather growth, after rupture of the feather sheath, this canal contained the upper part of the calamus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76c63bd4-aaa7-46da-a41e-6582bcaaeccc",
                                "sense_id": "daf3bffe-e7c5-37d8-b35d-184d40b40e9b",
                                "text": "Chapin asserted that the calamus is firmly fixed in the wing"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0437c406-cf55-382c-b72c-cf8a999cdbb5",
                        "entry_id": "adabbaba-d3b2-3cd7-933e-91c9c6d52ac8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fish of genus Calamus in family Sparidae; certain porgies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "17d45dfa-289c-3246-91dd-fd3691678431",
                        "entry_id": "adabbaba-d3b2-3cd7-933e-91c9c6d52ac8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A palm in genus Calamus, of rattan palms."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8affc63a-4898-3140-959a-9d55331dba37",
                        "entry_id": "adabbaba-d3b2-3cd7-933e-91c9c6d52ac8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fistular stem without an articulation."
